poof-source-v1.json retains the original Definitions, Examples and Checks
code blocks, with their source line identities and SHA256 hashes. The code
block contents are unmodified. The representation is an extracted JSON fixture.
The separate source checker removes display-only code:comment forms and
instruments eval:check/eval:error during test execution.
